		"name": "Fleet Management - Complete Trip Workflow",
		"description": "Complete workflow from trip request to driver assignment and trip execution.\n\nGate QR: folder **6. Gate scan & tracking extras** has `POST /trips/gate/start-from-scan` (same payload as the driver app QR). Run that **instead of Step 8** if you are testing the gate flow; do not run both on the same READY trip.",
